'''Blood''' may refer to:

== Mechanics ==

==== [[Challenges]] ====
[[Bloody Mary]]: A Bethany challenge that starts with some blood related items

==== Environment ====
* [[Blood Donation Machine]], a machine which depletes half of a Red Heart container in exchange for dropping coins.
* [[Red creep]], which represents blood.

== Blood in title ==
The word "blood" appears in the title of the item.

=== Collectibles ===
==== Activated ====
* {{I|Blood Rights}}, damages entire room at the cost of depleting a full [[Red Heart container]].

==== Passive ====
* {{I|Blood Bag}}, grants increased [[health]].
* {{I|Blood Clot}}, grants increased [[damage]] and [[range]].
* {{I|Blood of the Martyr}}, grants increased damage and turns Isaac's tears into '''blood''' tears.
* {{I|Bloody Lust}}, after taking damage, grants increased damage for the floor.
* {{I|Lusty Blood}}, increases damage by 0.5 up to 10 times in the current room each time a [[monster]] is defeated.
* {{I|Bloodshot Eye}}, Spawns an [[orbital familiar]] that deals 30 damage per second and fires a randomly angled tear every 2 seconds.
** Pickup quote states, "'''Blood'''y friend"
* {{I|Blood Bombs}}, Bombs leave behind damaging [[red creep]]. Isaac can place [[bomb]]s at the cost of half a heart if he doesn't have any. Pickup quote states,
** "'''Blood'''y blast + HP up"
* {{I|Blood Oath}}, Stabs Isaac at the beginning of each floor, draining his [[Red Heart container|Red Hearts]]. Increases [[damage]] and [[speed]] for the floor based on the amount drained.
* {{I|Blood Puppy}}, Spawns a [[familiar]] that chases enemies. After killing enough enemies, it becomes more powerful and drops [[Red Heart]]s after killing enemies, but will also try to hurt Isaac. Attacking it returns it to normal.
* {{I|Bloody Gust}}, When Isaac takes damage, he gains [[speed]] and [[tears]] for the rest of the floor.

=== Trinkets ===
* {{t|Bloody Penny}}, when a coin is collected, grants a 50% chance to drop a half [[Red Heart]].
* {{t|Bloody Crown}}, [[Treasure Room]]s now appear in [[chapter 4]].
** Pickup quote states, "Drips with '''blood.'''.."

