* {{I|Lead Pencil}}, After every 15 tears fired, Isaac will fire a high-damage cluster of blood red tears.
** Pickup quote states, " ''He's a bleeder!"''
* {{I|Shard of Glass}} Upon taking damage, Isaac has a chance to drop a full red heart,{{dlc|nr}}gain 5 range, and leave a trail of damaging red creep for the current room.
** Pickup quote states, "'''Blood''' and guts"
** {{Dlc|r}}Taking damage causes Isaac to bleed, spraying a volley of blood in the direction he fires. Bleeding will eventually damage him, but it can be stopped by picking up a Red Heart.
* {{I|Blood Oath}}, Stabs Isaac at the beginning of each floor, draining his [[Red Heart container|red hearts]]. Increases [[damage]] and [[speed]] for the floor based on the amount drained.
** Pickup quote states, " ''Bleed me dry"''

